        },
        {
          "word": "that",
          "start": 737.467,
          "end": 737.743,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "trap.",
          "start": 737.743,
          "end": 738.019,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, He created the heavens and the earth for a specific purpose, which is redeeming those among us who deserve to be redeemed.",
