          "end": 752.666,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "God's",
          "start": 752.666,
          "end": 753.036,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "kingdom.",
          "start": 753.036,
          "end": 753.406,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If we fail, then we'll be exiled from God's kingdom. And that is Hell.",
