        },
        {
          "word": "to",
          "start": 1152.153,
          "end": 1152.335,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "me.\"",
          "start": 1152.335,
          "end": 1152.517,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They think God doesn't see them.",
