    {
      "text": "[59:7]  The spoils of war that GOD bestows upon His messenger from the (damaged) inhabitants of the town shall go to GOD and messenger (in the form of charity) to the relatives, the needy, and the alien. In this way, it will not be monopolized by the rich among you. Any gained spoils that the messenger gives you, you shall accept, and whatever he forbids you, you shall leave. Beware of GOD. GOD is most strict in imposing punishments.",
