    {
      "text": "[59:9]  And those who had established their homes (unintelligible), previously, where they welcome the immigrants who come to them, and find no hesitation in their hearts to give them what they need. They even prefer them over themselves, even though they themselves may be in need. Then, you understand the stingy nature of the self. These are the winners.",
