        },
        {
          "word": "not.",
          "start": 3423.528,
          "end": 3423.758,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, God gives us the criterion, criteria.",
      "start": 3423.758,
      "end": 3426.695,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "So,",
