        },
        {
          "word": "it.",
          "start": 3429.871,
          "end": 3430.101,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But when Muhammad is mentioned with Him or somebody else is mentioned with God, then they like it.",
