        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This is in Sura 39, verse 45.",
      "start": 3434.386,
      "end": 3436.386,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "This",
          "start": 3434.386,
          "end": 3434.672,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "is",
          "start": 3434.672,
          "end": 3434.957,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "in",
          "start": 3434.957,
          "end": 3435.243,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Sura",
          "start": 3435.243,
          "end": 3435.529,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "39,",
          "start": 3435.529,
          "end": 3435.815,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "verse",
          "start": 3435.815,
          "end": 3436.1,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "45.",
          "start": 3436.1,
          "end": 3436.386,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, there are criteria in the Quran that will tell the person whether he or she is a believer or not.",
