          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And the Quran writes about them two verses.",
      "start": 3451.167,
      "end": 3453.519,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "And",
          "start": 3451.167,
          "end": 3451.461,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "the",
          "start": 3451.461,
          "end": 3451.755,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Quran",
          "start": 3451.755,
          "end": 3452.049,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "writes",
          "start": 3452.049,
          "end": 3452.343,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "about",
          "start": 3452.343,
          "end": 3452.637,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "them",
          "start": 3452.637,
          "end": 3452.931,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "two",
          "start": 3452.931,
          "end": 3453.225,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "verses.",
          "start": 3453.225,
          "end": 3453.519,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But a hypocrite is one who says that he or she is a believer, when they are not believers.",
