          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "them.",
          "start": 3463.722,
          "end": 3464.08,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because they are more damaging than the disbelievers.",
