          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": "Also,...",
          "start": 3588.136,
          "end": 3588.931,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, a good example of the, of the hypocrites, if I may say so, is Khomeini, for example.",
